  m_text: "The world has melted.\nReality fractured three months ago and nobody knows
    why.\nColours bleed into each other. The ground breathes.\nCreatures born from
    the chaos hunt anything still sane.\nYou are the last one left. Survive 20 waves.\nWhatever
    is waiting on the other side \u2014 face it.\n... or that little tab you took
    from that shady guy\nin your math class wasn't what he said it was...\nEither
    way, GOOD LUCK!!"
